{"changes":[{"path":"python_programs/lis.py","edits":[{"old":"        if length == longest or val < arr[ends[length + 1]]:
            ends[length + 1] = i
            longest = length + 1","new":"        if length == longest or val < arr[ends[length + 1]]:
            ends[length + 1] = i

        if length + 1 > longest:
            longest = length + 1"}]}],"explanation":"原代码在 val >= arr[ends[length+1]] 时虽然不更新 ends，但仍无条件执行 longest = length + 1，导致最长长度被错误增大（如遇到较小元素时也递增）。修复为：只要 length == longest（即找到更长的子序列）就更新 ends 和最长长度；否则若 val 更小仅替换 ends[length+1]，但不改变 longest。这保持了标准 LIS 的 patience 算法逻辑。","evidence_ids":["test-baseline"],"knowledge_citations":["knowledge-public_tasks","knowledge-testing"]}
